[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2882.15, "timestamp": "00:48:02", "text": "我太不擅长写作了。有时仅"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2884.47, "timestamp": "00:48:04", "text": "有时候确实有效。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2887.27, "timestamp": "00:48:07", "text": "有时却不起作用。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2889.91, "timestamp": "00:48:09", "text": "而且除此之外，我的感官也很敏锐。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2891.75, "timestamp": "00:48:11", "text": "现在播放。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2898.39, "timestamp": "00:48:18", "text": "控制一切。无法控制"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2911.109, "timestamp": "00:48:31", "text": "是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2921.67, "timestamp": "00:48:41", "text": "但我觉得主要还是我自己的问题。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2923.349, "timestamp": "00:48:43", "text": "想太多。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2926.069, "timestamp": "00:48:46", "text": "所以我现在要赶路了。"}]